  ⚠ Approve proposal p-0020 and add this grant?                                                                         
                                                                                                                        
  Yes runs the command shown. It marks the proposal as approved and then adds the grant, the way qhost grant add adds   
  it. It refuses and applies nothing if the proposal or the grant is not the one you see. The grant holds for the user  
  and every agent under that account.                                                                                   
    ana (uid 1001) may update the stack demo without sudo, as a standing permission.                                    
    expiry asked for: after the end of 2030-01-31 (UTC)                                                                 
    Reason of the submitter, as written                                                                                 
    > Our deploy bot restarts the demo app after each release.                                                          
    expiry of the grant: after the end of 2030-01-15 (UTC)                                                              
    You set this expiry; it is not the one asked for.                                                                   
    backup of the stack: set up                                                                                         
    health check of the stack: not set up                                                                               
    !! An update started with this grant commits and pushes to the source of the stack.                                 
                                                                                                                        
    $ sudo qhost proposal approve p-0020 --fingerprint fp-p-0020 --expires 2030-01-15 --confirm --output json           
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
